#: ../../source/reference/aabbox.rst:13
msgid ""
"Bounded volume in space in the form of a rectangular parallelepiped, with"
" a period parallel to the coordinate axes in the world system. When the "
"object rotates, the AABB changes its dimensions, but it always remains "
"oriented along the coordinate axes. Axis Aligned Bounding Box represented"
" by center of box and extent."
msgstr ""

